{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"Far beyond our solar system are giant families of stars called galaxies.","words":[[0,0.35],[0.43,0.82],[0.89,1.07],[1.15,1.54],[1.63,2.06],[2.14,2.32],[2.4,2.79],[2.86,3.34],[3.4,3.5],[3.58,4.03],[4.11,4.42],[4.48,5.67]]},{"text":"A galaxy holds billions of stars, along with planets, gas, and dust.","words":[[0,0.12],[0.21,0.69],[0.77,1.1],[1.18,1.66],[1.71,1.78],[1.85,2.54],[2.79,3.1],[3.15,3.31],[3.38,3.98],[4.12,4.6],[4.64,4.83],[4.92,5.76]]},{"text":"Our home galaxy is called the Milky Way. It looks like a glowing swirl in space.","words":[[0,0.21],[0.28,0.56],[0.6,1.2],[1.26,1.37],[1.45,1.75],[1.78,1.85],[1.92,2.31],[2.38,2.82],[3.15,3.29],[3.33,3.58],[3.62,3.82],[3.87,3.89],[3.97,4.43],[4.52,4.96],[5.03,5.13],[5.21,6.18]]},{"text":"The Milky Way is so big that it takes light a very long time to cross it.","words":[[0,0.19],[0.26,0.63],[0.71,0.92],[0.97,1.09],[1.17,1.47],[1.61,1.89],[1.96,2.14],[2.21,2.31],[2.36,2.67],[2.75,3.06],[3.11,3.13],[3.23,3.53],[3.61,3.88],[3.96,4.31],[4.35,4.42],[4.5,4.87],[4.93,5.53]]},{"text":"Inside the Milky Way is our solar system, with the Sun and all its planets.","words":[[0,0.6],[0.63,0.7],[0.77,1.15],[1.22,1.44],[1.52,1.63],[1.7,1.88],[1.97,2.37],[2.45,3.08],[3.37,3.59],[3.63,3.7],[3.79,4.12],[4.2,4.38],[4.47,4.68],[4.75,4.92],[4.99,5.94]]},{"text":"Earth is a tiny home inside the solar system, inside the Milky Way galaxy.","words":[[0,0.36],[0.43,0.57],[0.63,0.67],[0.76,1.14],[1.22,1.52],[1.57,1.96],[1.99,2.06],[2.11,2.52],[2.59,3.19],[3.52,3.96],[3.98,4.05],[4.14,4.56],[4.64,4.84],[4.93,6.04]]},{"text":"There are many other galaxies besides the Milky Way, spread across space.","words":[[0,0.27],[0.31,0.46],[0.53,0.8],[0.88,1.13],[1.2,1.9],[2,2.45],[2.5,2.57],[2.63,3.01],[3.09,3.47],[3.76,4.14],[4.19,4.57],[4.62,5.57]]},{"text":"Galaxies are very far apart. Space between them is wide and quiet.","words":[[0,0.72],[0.79,0.99],[1.08,1.38],[1.46,1.74],[1.81,2.52],[2.81,3.2],[3.25,3.68],[3.73,3.88],[3.96,4.08],[4.21,4.62],[4.67,4.76],[4.85,5.8]]},{"text":"Galaxies slowly move and change over very long times.","words":[[0,0.61],[0.66,1.13],[1.21,1.53],[1.59,1.74],[1.82,2.22],[2.28,2.48],[2.59,2.9],[2.97,3.24],[3.32,4.23]]},{"text":"At bedtime, we remember: Earth lives in the solar system, inside the Milky Way galaxy.","words":[[0,0.2],[0.27,0.88],[0.93,1.08],[1.17,1.92],[2.3,2.61],[2.69,2.96],[3.02,3.09],[3.13,3.2],[3.27,3.67],[3.74,4.4],[4.69,5.13],[5.16,5.22],[5.29,5.65],[5.72,5.91],[5.99,7.06]]}]}